        <title>靶场搭建教程</title>
        <link>https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/</link>
        <pubDate>Sun, 15 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/111.png" alt="Featured image of post 靶场搭建教程" /&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;前言&#34;&gt;前言
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;搭建靶场前需要用到PHP和Apache环境运行，我这里用的是phpstudy。&lt;br&gt;
在phpstudy上搭建靶场的步骤基本都一样，不过有些小细节还是要注意一下的。&lt;br&gt;
该工具的具体安装可以看我的另一篇教程：&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phptool/?t=1773220648713&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PHP代码审计工具安装教程&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;一-dvwa&#34;&gt;一. DVWA
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;1启动apache和mysql&#34;&gt;1.启动Apache和MySQL
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.1.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1195&#34;
	height=&#34;940&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.1_hu_a58babf42d95e017.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.1_hu_df222164ba376e1.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;127&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;305px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;2下载dvwa工程&#34;&gt;2.下载DVWA工程
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;原官网已失效，从网盘下载：&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://pan.baidu.com/s/1jvMZOfY-iTUgUBrk9qMncg?pwd=8888&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://pan.baidu.com/s/1jvMZOfY-iTUgUBrk9qMncg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
提取吗：8888&lt;br&gt;
下载以后解压，把解压后的代码放在PHPStudy的WWW路径下（根目录）。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.2.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1205&#34;
	height=&#34;605&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.2_hu_80a60409a7b6b992.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.2_hu_7400ae8f75367ae9.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;199&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;478px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;注意：把DVWA文件夹放在WWW下面，不能再嵌套文件夹，也不能直接把代码文件放在WWW目录下。&lt;br&gt;
与我下图一样即可。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.3.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1181&#34;
	height=&#34;1018&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.3_hu_97fa046f62de84c8.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.3_hu_ab3cbc2deebdb11.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;116&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;278px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;3添加网站&#34;&gt;3.添加网站
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;打开phpstudy，添加网站。这一步除了填写域名，其他的都不用改。&lt;br&gt;
域名跟上一步的文件夹名字一致，会自动填充根目录。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.4.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1191&#34;
	height=&#34;925&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.4_hu_8dbf63bcc4e84ebc.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.4_hu_5ce3a3999308975.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;128&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;309px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;部署成功以后Apache会自动重启，访问地址：&lt;br&gt;
http://localhost/dvwa 或者 http://dvwa/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;4初始化数据库&#34;&gt;4.初始化数据库
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;修改配置文件：&lt;br&gt;
&lt;span style=&#34;color: #e74c3c;&#34;&gt;WWW\DVWA\config\config.inc.php&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
（如果没有这个文件，把config.inc.php.dist复制一份，改名为config.inc.php）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.5.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1198&#34;
	height=&#34;402&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.5_hu_d7c31ca303730b53.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.5_hu_14bf90e69ce232ef.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;298&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;715px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;修改IP、库名（默认dvwa不用改）、用户名、密码、端口&lt;br&gt;
注意phpstudy自带的数据库默认密码是root&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.6.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;686&#34;
	height=&#34;230&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.6_hu_3ef1bb9010cfb2f0.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.6_hu_9dce54c1cada5f53.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;298&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;715px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;其中的user和password，可以参考phpstudy中数据库页面。&lt;br&gt;
我这里密码改成123456了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.7.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1194&#34;
	height=&#34;932&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.7_hu_86f2b7f6ddba789.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.7_hu_36bfc91e42ef4674.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;128&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;307px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;打开首页&lt;br&gt;
http://localhost/dvwa 或者 http://dvwa/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.8.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;598&#34;
	height=&#34;604&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.8_hu_ac55eb7a9e6acfc.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.8_hu_abfae95291c2529f.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;99&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;237px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;点击最下方的 Create /Reset Database初始化数据库&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.9.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;217&#34;
	height=&#34;88&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.9_hu_c1fa374e5035a8bb.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.9_hu_a7054215070714e7.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;246&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;591px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;php配置文件有两个值要修改。&lt;br&gt;
比如当前的php版本是7.3.4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.10.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;681&#34;
	height=&#34;687&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.10_hu_7ee375634ea0e4d9.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.10_hu_1425e63f74e79af7.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;99&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;237px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;那么PHP的配置文件是：&lt;span style=&#34;color: #e74c3c;&#34;&gt;phpstudy_pro\Extensions\php\php7.3.4nts\php.ini&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.11.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1141&#34;
	height=&#34;633&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.11_hu_d8237a3c9a4de67.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.11_hu_c7aea2266c1ca1d.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;180&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;432px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;以下两个值，要从Off改为On&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.12.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1030&#34;
	height=&#34;645&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.12_hu_e5eef1df6f72b737.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.12_hu_10257ef530c11ec1.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;159&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;383px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;5登录&#34;&gt;5.登录
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;初始化以后可以登录&lt;br&gt;
http://localhost/dvwa 或者 http://dvwa/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.13.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;591&#34;
	height=&#34;501&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.13_hu_7bacc99eb1057108.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.13_hu_80a9df256bd4ddc4.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;117&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;283px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;默认用户名和密码是 admin / passoword&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这样DVWA靶场就搭建好啦。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.14.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1384&#34;
	height=&#34;1412&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.14_hu_9e9b92fdb70318c1.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/1.14_hu_1af87e2e2afbd5d3.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;98&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;235px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;二-vauditdemo&#34;&gt;二. VAuditDemo
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;1下载&#34;&gt;1.下载
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;下载地址：&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/1stPeak/VAuditDemo&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://github.com/1stPeak/VAuditDemo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
解压在WWW目录下后，将VAuditDemo_Release目录中所有的文件剪贴到vauditdemo目录下。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.2.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1139&#34;
	height=&#34;932&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.2_hu_70db33ef42d650b3.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.2_hu_6029921cbd25225.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;122&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;293px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;2配置信息&#34;&gt;2.配置信息
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.1.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1391&#34;
	height=&#34;1017&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.1_hu_42106fdb146bcefb.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.1_hu_d6ee70658c0153d4.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;136&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;328px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这里要创建一个数据库。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.3.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;532&#34;
	height=&#34;333&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.3_hu_d75fa112e0f3a17c.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.3_hu_64e432fdfab8fd47.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;159&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;383px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;3登录&#34;&gt;3.登录
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;访问 vauditdemo/ 即可进入靶场。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.4.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;2018&#34;
	height=&#34;856&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.4_hu_d7929f089383f1e0.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/2.4_hu_d2d76d4045b60c71.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;235&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;565px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;三yxcms&#34;&gt;三.YXCMS
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;1下载-1&#34;&gt;1.下载
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;网盘连接：&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://pan.baidu.com/s/1q_GHo4PPvreWHACpIYH2qg&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt; https://pan.baidu.com/s/1q_GHo4PPvreWHACpIYH2qg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
提取码：q265&lt;br&gt;
将文件夹放在WWW目录下后，并将文件夹名字改为yxcms。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.1.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1100&#34;
	height=&#34;698&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.1_hu_9899cfde9c35937d.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.1_hu_f83a8720a3d99fc0.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;157&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;378px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;2配置信息-1&#34;&gt;2.配置信息
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.2.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;686&#34;
	height=&#34;693&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.2_hu_6f5f1c614fe62431.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.2_hu_c0262e741ef9f6cc.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;98&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;237px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;创建数据库需要和config.php文件信息一样。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.6.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;686&#34;
	height=&#34;693&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.6_hu_ac6a4b9f715202ed.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.6_hu_df6f3aa29962fc9b.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;98&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;237px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;打开文件&lt;span style=&#34;color: #e74c3c;&#34;&gt;\phpstudy_pro\WWW\yxcms\protected\config.php&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
数据库配置信息保证与该文件配置信息一致。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.5.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1080&#34;
	height=&#34;717&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.5_hu_2010d2174aedd1f4.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.5_hu_71b821596cb69055.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;150&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;361px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;创建好网站和数据库后，在访问浏览器访问/localhost/yxcms&lt;br&gt;
会自动进入安装导向，在数据库安装的选项上需要与刚刚的配置信息一致。&lt;br&gt;
其他的一直下一步即可。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.4.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1400&#34;
	height=&#34;968&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.4_hu_b024f5687ed9dcb5.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.4_hu_e36288b5e5674a60.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;144&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;347px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;然后就安装完成了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/bachang/3.8.jpg&#34;
